# KB viva del profilo: caricamento completo. Le precedenti misure con KB
# ridotta sono obsolete; le attese legacy richiedono rivalidazione semantica.
# migrated from tests/cases/unify.chat (gen346, hermetic + isolated)
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test unify]
# Generation 5: variable queries resolved by unification over the facts.
> socrates is a man
< Learned: socrates is a man.
> plato is a man
< Learned: plato is a man.
> aristotle is a man
< Learned: aristotle is a man.
# "who is a X?" binds the variable to every matching subject, in order.
> who is a man?
< socrates, plato, aristotle.
# "what is a X?" works the same way.
> rex is a dog
< Learned: rex is a dog.
> what is a dog?
< rex.
# Predicate never mentioned -> "I don't know" (gen16), distinct from a known
# predicate with no members ("Nobody that I know of.").
> who is a robot?
< I don't know about robot.
# Ground query still works (no regression).
> is socrates a man?
< Yes.

